{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2022-04-19 10:15:00', 'title': 'THREE ADVISORS WITH COMBINED $546 MILLION IN ASSETS MOVE THEIR BUSINESSES TO AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS PRACTICE', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: AMP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SPRINGS WEALTH GROUP, A WELL-ESTABLISHED TEAM IN THE COMPANY'S FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS GROUP LED BY CHRIS YOUNG, CFP®, CEPA®, CHRIS VAN STAVERN, AND ANDY INMAN, CEPA®, HAS EXPANDED WITH THE ADDITION OF THREE ADVISORS WHO COLLECTIVELY MANAGE $546 MILLION IN CLIENT ASSETS: ROBERT “BOB” BOOK, AIF®, AND TIMOTHY “TIM” MASON, CFP®, CHFC®, CLU® JOINED FROM SECURIAN FINANCIAL SERVICES WHERE THEY TOGETHER MANAGED $4"}